<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 17 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 17 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 17.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on June 30.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 13 trillion lire on May 26, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.77 percent and the average rate at 6.81.</p>
</text>
